{"id":"C887907fc76e474289e03","zh":"CA砂浆","en":"CA mortar","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","definition_zh":"文中用于板式轨道层间连接或填充的水泥乳化沥青砂浆。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"CA砂浆在板式轨道中承担轨道板下的填充、支承和层间连接作用。动力模型常以连续分布的弹簧和阻尼器表示其作用；离缝损伤分析则关注其局部支承作用的丧失。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C887907fc76e474289e03","zh":"CA砂浆","en":"CA mortar","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"H3fe140ef5a8cacaa7c6a","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道结构与动力学 · 陈宪麦等（2024）"}],"designations":[{"id":"Dde82e3da3055e44faf04","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"CA砂浆"},{"id":"D6283443c4e316bb948d9","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"CA mortar"}],"sources":{"P126":{"id":"P126","title":"基于1D-CNN的无砟轨道CA砂浆脱空识别","authors":"陈宪麦,李鑫海,徐磊,邓燚,黄厚龙,邓云强","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20230843","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-ca-mortar-void-identification-for-ballastless-track-using-1d-cnn"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S854b13d5c5be7a04af76","source_id":"P126","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"The advantages of 1D-CNN applied to CA mortar void recognition were discussed by comparing the performance of the other 3 neural networks.","citations":[{"source_id":"P126","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S7418054ffc2d9ce90986","source_id":"P126","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"From a deep learning perspective, the CA mortar void in the middle of the slab is less damaging and should focus on maintaining the CA mortar void at the slab end.","citations":[{"source_id":"P126","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S080f61940c3dbbaacca1","source_id":"P126","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"可见,无砟轨道CA 砂浆脱空识别的实验方法主要是冲击回波法,仿真方法主要基于车辆轨道耦合动力学。","citations":[{"source_id":"P126","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S28ae5e401786324bbc6e","source_id":"P126","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"石慧 [7]以车辆轨道耦合动力学为基础,将CA 砂浆脱空行为简化为非线性弹簧,在兼顾仿真结果准确性的基础上实现了较高的计算效率。","citations":[{"source_id":"P126","pag